- Certificate issuance cannot be triggered by an unauthorized client.
- Audit records cannot be altered by ordinary learners.
- Storage policies protect private files and uploads.

Use a trusted server-side process for privileged administrative operations.

Do not rely exclusively on frontend route guards or hidden navigation links.

Test RLS policies and authorization logic with representative anonymous, learner, instructor, manager, and Super Admin accounts.

